# SHAC (Xu et al. 2022, arXiv:2204.07137) at the scale of NablaMimic: the same environment, actor (encoder-decoder
# 2048-1024-512-256), critic, 4096 environments, learning-rate schedule and action noise. SHAC's algorithm: H = 32
# windows continued across updates (no replay, no collector), one Adam step on the actor's window gradient (no action
# targets, no per-sample clipping, no termination penalty), TD(lambda = 0.95) critic, empirical observation
# normalization, uniform reset sampling over frames. The including file chooses the simulator.
--seed 0 --clips all --num-envs 4096 --horizon 32 --solver-iterations 10
--reset-sampling uniform --actor-obs-norm --act-noise 0.05
--lr 2e-4 --iters 400000 --lr-warmup-steps 500 --lr-decay-to 0.1 --lr-decay-steps 16000
--ckpt-every 250
